<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>B787 Transition Trainer for Airbus Pilots (MCP + PFD + ND + FMS)</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg-cockpit: #0d1015;
    --panel-bg: #1b2028;
    --panel-border: #313947;
    --mcp-bg: #262c36;
    --lcd-bg: #080d0a;
    --boeing-green: #00ff66;
    --boeing-cyan: #00e5ff;
    --boeing-magenta: #ff4dff;
    --boeing-amber: #ffaa00;
    --boeing-white: #f1f5f9;
    --sky-blue: #0066b2;
    --ground-brown: #6e4720;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    user-select: none;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px;
    background: var(--bg-cockpit);
    color: var(--boeing-white);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Consolas, monospace;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* Top Header & Scenarios */
  .top-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: #141820;
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--boeing-cyan);
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .title-block h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .title-block span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .scenario-btns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .scn-btn {
    background: #252d3a;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    border: 1px solid #475569;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }

  .scn-btn:hover {
    background: #334155;
    border-color: var(--boeing-cyan);
  }

  .scn-btn.download {
    background: #059669;
    border-color: #10b981;
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* ==================== MCP PANEL ==================== */
  .mcp-panel {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2b323d 0%, #1e232b 100%);
    border: 2px solid #3f4859;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }

  .mcp-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid #333b48;
  }

  .mcp-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .mcp-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
  }

  .mcp-window {
    background: var(--lcd-bg);
    border: 2px solid #111;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--boeing-white);
    font-family: 'Consolas', monospace;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    min-width: 68px;
    height: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 22px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
  }

  .mcp-window.blank {
    color: #1e293b;
  }

  .knob-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .knob-step {
    background: #384152;
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #525f75;
    border-radius: 3px;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .knob-step:active {
    background: #4f5b73;
  }

  .knob-push {
    background: #1e293b;
    color: var(--boeing-cyan);
    border: 1px solid var(--boeing-cyan);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    height: 24px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.1s;
  }

  .knob-push:hover {
    background: var(--boeing-cyan);
    color: #000;
  }

  /* MCP Mode Pushbutton with Green Light Bar */
  .mcp-btn {
    background: #2c3442;
    border: 2px solid #475266;
    border-radius: 5px;
    width: 58px;
    height: 40px;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 3px;
  }

  .mcp-btn:active {
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }

  .light-bar {
    width: 75%;
    height: 5px;
    background: #151b18;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }

  .mcp-btn.active .light-bar {
    background: var(--boeing-green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--boeing-green);
  }

  /* ==================== MAIN DISPLAYS GRID ==================== */
  .cockpit-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1.05fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1150px) {
    .cockpit-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .cockpit-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .display-bezel {
    background: #1a1f27;
    border: 3px solid #2e3644;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
  }

  .bezel-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  canvas.efis-canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: 390px;
    background: #040609;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid #222936;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ==================== FMS CDU PANEL ==================== */
  .cdu-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .cdu-screen-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr 38px;
    gap: 4px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .lsk-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 32px 0 28px 0;
  }

  .lsk-key {
    height: 28px;
    background: #2d3440;
    border: 1px solid #4b5566;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .lsk-key:active {
    background: #475569;
  }

  .cdu-lcd {
    background: #05070b;
    border: 2px solid #222936;
    border-radius: 4px;
    height: 265px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    font-family: 'Consolas', monospace;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .cdu-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .badge-mod {
    background: var(--boeing-cyan);
    color: #000;
    padding: 0 5px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .badge-act {
    color: var(--boeing-cyan);
  }

  .cdu-rows {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 4px 0;
  }

  .cdu-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 32px;
  }

  .cdu-side {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .cdu-side.r {
    text-align: right;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .cdu-lbl {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--boeing-cyan);
    height: 12px;
  }

  .cdu-val {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .cdu-sp {
    border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
    height: 22px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .cdu-keys {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .cdu-k {
    background: #2b323f;
    border: 1px solid #475266;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #fff;
    height: 30px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .cdu-k.exec-btn {
    background: #1f2d24;
    border-color: #2e4736;
  }

  .exec-lamp {
    width: 70%;
    height: 4px;
    background: #121a15;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .exec-lamp.on {
    background: var(--boeing-green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--boeing-green);
  }

  /* ==================== AIRBUS VS BOEING COACH BAR ==================== */
  .coach-box {
    background: #141923;
    border: 1px solid #2e3a4f;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--boeing-magenta);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .coach-box {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .coach-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--boeing-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .airbus-compare {
    background: #1d2432;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .tag-bus {
    background: #0284c7;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .tag-b787 {
    background: #7c3aed;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- TOP BAR: SCENARIO PRESETS FOR AIRBUS TRANSITION -->
<div class="top-bar">
  <div class="title-block">
    <h1>B787 INTEGRATED FLIGHT DECK — AIRBUS PILOT TRANSITION SIMULATOR</h1>
    <span>MCP · PFD (FMA) · ND · FMS 실시간 연동 | 조작할 때마다 하단에 Airbus vs Boeing 로직 비교가 표시됩니다.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="scenario-btns">
    <button class="scn-btn" onclick="loadScenario('VNAV_ALT')">시나리오 1: VNAV ALT 걸림 & 고도 개입(ALT INTV)</button>
    <button class="scn-btn" onclick="loadScenario('SPD_INTV')">시나리오 2: VNAV 중 속도 개입(SPD INTV)</button>
    <button class="scn-btn" onclick="loadScenario('DIR_TO')">시나리오 3: Direct-To (MOD 파선 → EXEC)</button>
    <button class="scn-btn" onclick="loadScenario('FLCH_VS_VNAV')">시나리오 4: FLCH vs VNAV 강하 비교</button>
    <button class="scn-btn download" onclick="downloadSelf()">💾 단독 HTML 저장</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ==================== BOEING 787 MCP ==================== -->
<div class="mcp-panel">
  <!-- A/T & IAS/MACH -->
  <div class="mcp-group">
    <button id="btnAT" class="mcp-btn active" onclick="toggleAT()">
      <div class="light-bar"></div>
      A/T
    </button>
    <button id="btnLNAV" class="mcp-btn active" onclick="pressLNAV()">
      <div class="light-bar"></div>
      LNAV
    </button>
    <button id="btnVNAV" class="mcp-btn active" onclick="pressVNAV()">
      <div class="light-bar"></div>
      VNAV
    </button>
    <div class="mcp-col">
      <div class="mcp-label">IAS / MACH</div>
      <div id="winSpd" class="mcp-window blank">---</div>
      <div class="knob-row">
        <button class="knob-step" onclick="changeSpd(-5)">-</button>
        <button class="knob-push" onclick="pushSpdIntv()" title="Airbus Pull/Push Speed에 해당">PUSH (SPD INTV)</button>
        <button class="knob-step" onclick="changeSpd(5)">+</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button id="btnFLCH" class="mcp-btn" onclick="pressFLCH()">
      <div class="light-bar"></div>
      FLCH
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- HEADING -->
  <div class="mcp-group">
    <div class="mcp-col">
      <div class="mcp-label">HDG / TRK</div>
      <div id="winHdg" class="mcp-window">050</div>
      <div class="knob-row">
        <button class="knob-step" onclick="changeHdg(-5)">◀</button>
        <button class="knob-push" onclick="pressHdgSel()" title="Airbus Pull HDG (Selected)에 해당">PUSH (SEL)</button>
        <button class="knob-step" onclick="changeHdg(5)">▶</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button id="btnHDG" class="mcp-btn" onclick="pressHdgSel()">
      <div class="light-bar"></div>
      HDG SEL
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- VERTICAL SPEED -->
  <div class="mcp-group">
    <div class="mcp-col">
      <div class="mcp-label">VERT SPD</div>
      <div id="winVS" class="mcp-window blank">----</div>
      <div class="knob-row">
        <button class="knob-step" onclick="changeVS(-200)">▼</button>
        <button id="btnVS" class="mcp-btn" style="height:26px; width:48px;" onclick="pressVS()">
          <div class="light-bar"></div>
          V/S
        </button>
        <button class="knob-step" onclick="changeVS(200)">▲</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ALTITUDE -->
  <div class="mcp-group">
    <div class="mcp-col">
      <div class="mcp-label">ALTITUDE (FT)</div>
      <div id="winAlt" class="mcp-window">10000</div>
      <div class="knob-row">
        <button class="knob-step" onclick="changeAlt(-1000)">-</button>
        <button class="knob-push" onclick="pushAltIntv()" title="구속고도 삭제 또는 VNAV ALT 해제">PUSH (ALT INTV)</button>
        <button class="knob-step" onclick="changeAlt(1000)">+</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button id="btnHOLD" class="mcp-btn" onclick="pressAltHold()">
      <div class="light-bar"></div>
      ALT HOLD
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- AP & APP -->
  <div class="mcp-group">
    <button id="btnAPP" class="mcp-btn" onclick="pressAPP()">
      <div class="light-bar"></div>
      APP
    </button>
    <button id="btnAP" class="mcp-btn active" onclick="toggleAP()">
      <div class="light-bar"></div>
      AP
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ==================== COCKPIT DISPLAYS: PFD + ND + FMS ==================== -->
<div class="cockpit-grid">
  <!-- 1. PFD -->
  <div class="display-bezel">
    <div class="bezel-header">
      <span>PRIMARY FLIGHT DISPLAY (PFD)</span>
      <span style="color:var(--boeing-green)">FMA 3-COLUMN: [A/T] | [ROLL] | [PITCH]</span>
    </div>
    <canvas id="pfdCanvas" class="efis-canvas" width="440" height="390"></canvas>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. ND -->
  <div class="display-bezel">
    <div class="bezel-header">
      <span>NAVIGATION DISPLAY (MAP MODE)</span>
      <span><span style="color:var(--boeing-magenta)">━━ ACT RTE</span> &nbsp; <span style="color:var(--boeing-cyan)">┅┅ MOD RTE</span></span>
    </div>
    <canvas id="ndCanvas" class="efis-canvas" width="440" height="390"></canvas>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. FMS VIRTUAL CDU -->
  <div class="display-bezel">
    <div class="bezel-header">
      <span>FMS CDU (LEGS & VNAV LINKED)</span>
      <span style="color:var(--boeing-cyan)">LSK 클릭으로 DIRECT-TO / 고도제한 수정</span>
    </div>

    <div class="cdu-container">
      <div class="cdu-screen-wrap">
        <div class="lsk-col">
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('1L')">1L</button>
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('2L')">2L</button>
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('3L')">3L</button>
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('4L')">4L</button>
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('5L')">5L</button>
        </div>

        <div class="cdu-lcd">
          <div class="cdu-top">
            <span id="cduBadge" class="badge-act">ACT</span>
            <span id="cduTitle" style="color:var(--boeing-cyan)">RTE 1 LEGS</span>
            <span style="color:var(--boeing-cyan)">1/1</span>
          </div>
          <div id="cduRows" class="cdu-rows"></div>
          <div class="cdu-sp">
            <span id="cduSpText"></span>
            <span id="cduSpMsg" style="color:var(--boeing-amber); font-size:11px;"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lsk-col">
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('1R')">1R</button>
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('2R')">2R</button>
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('3R')">3R</button>
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('4R')">4R</button>
          <button class="lsk-key" onclick="cduLSK('5R')">5R</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Compact Fast-Entry Keypad for CDU -->
      <div class="cdu-keys">
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduPage('LEGS')">LEGS</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduPage('VNAV')">VNAV</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduSpPreset('250/10000A')">250/100A</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduSpPreset('280/14000B')">280/140B</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduSpPreset('DELETE')">DEL</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduClr()">CLR</button>

        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduChar('1')">1</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduChar('2')">2</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduChar('5')">5</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduChar('0')">0</button>
        <button class="cdu-k" onclick="cduChar('/')">/</button>
        <button class="cdu-k exec-btn" onclick="cduExec()">
          <div id="execLamp" class="exec-lamp"></div>
          EXEC
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ==================== REAL-TIME AIRBUS VS BOEING INSTRUCTOR BAR ==================== -->
<div class="coach-box">
  <div>
    <div class="coach-title" id="coachHeadline">✈️ 현재 비행 상태 및 FMA 해설</div>
    <div id="coachDetail" style="color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.5;">
      현재 LNAV 및 VNAV가 결합되어 상승 중입니다. MCP 고도창(10,000ft) 또는 다음 웨이포인트(BOPTA 10000A) 중 더 낮은 고도에 도달하면 보잉 특유의 <b>VNAV ALT</b>가 작동합니다.
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="airbus-compare" id="coachCompare">
    <span class="tag-bus">Airbus A320/A330/A350</span> 노브를 <b>Push(Managed)</b>하면 `CLB / NAV`가 결합됨.<br>
    <span class="tag-b787">Boeing 787</span> 별도의 <b>LNAV, VNAV 버튼</b>을 눌러 결합하며, VNAV 중 속도를 바꾸려면 IAS 노브를 <b>PUSH(Speed Intervention)</b>하여 속도창을 엽니다.
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  // ==================== INTEGRATED FLIGHT STATE ====================
  const sim = {
    // Aircraft Dynamics
    ias: 215,
    tas: 230,
    alt: 6800,
    vs: 1800,
    hdg: 050,
    pitch: 7.5,
    bank: 0,
    // Aircraft Map Position (NM relative to origin)
    acX: 0,
    acY: 0,

    // MCP Selections
    mcpSpd: 250,
    spdWindowOpen: false, // Closed in VNAV PTH/SPD unless Speed Intervention pressed
    mcpHdg: 050,
    mcpAlt: 10000,
    mcpVS: 1500,
    atArmed: true,
    apEngaged: true,

    // Active MCP Button Lights
    btnLNAV: true,
    btnVNAV: true,
    btnFLCH: false,
    btnHDG: false,
    btnVS: false,
    btnHOLD: false,
    btnAPP: false,

    // 3-Column Boeing FMA + Armed Modes
    fmaAT: 'THR REF',
    fmaRoll: 'LNAV',
    fmaPitch: 'VNAV SPD',
    fmaRollArmed: '',
    fmaPitchArmed: '',
    fmaChangedCol: 0, // 1=AT, 2=Roll, 3=Pitch highlight box timer
    fmaBoxTimer: 0,

    // FMS Route & Modification State
    cduPage: 'LEGS',
    isMod: false,
    scratchpad: '',
    spMsg: '',
    fmsTargetSpd: 250,
    fmsCrzAlt: 35000,

    // Active & Mod Waypoints (x, y in NM)
    legs: [
      { id: 'BOPTA', x: 12, y: 14, spd: 250, alt: 10000, type: 'AT' },
      { id: 'NOPIK', x: 26, y: 32, spd: 290, alt: 16000, type: 'AT_OR_BELOW' },
